\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. I bow in silence at Thy feet;
\par Come to my soul and make it meet
\par To hold divine communion sweet,
\par My Lord, my life, my all.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. Thou know'st the evil thoughts within
\par That make it hard for me to win
\par The victory over self and sin,
\par My Lord, my life, my all.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. Thou too art man and knowest all
\par That would my love from The recall;
\par Wilt Thou be near me, lest I fall,
\par My Lord, my life, my all.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4. I have no power save Thine alone,
\par Help me to make this heart Thine own,
\par Rule Thou my life, there find Thy throne,
\par My Lord, my life, my all.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 5\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 5. I bow in silence at Thy feet;
\par Hear Thou the prayer which I repeat;
\par O make my sacrifice complete,
\par My Lord, my life, my all.
\par                          Amen.\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\fs16 
\par }

